        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CSA13, Solid Brass Colonial Style 13 Inch Window Stay Adjuster</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCasement stays hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. This 13 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The colonial design makes it perfect for traditional style homes. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CSA13-Specifications.gif?v=1704354780\" width=\"600\" height=\"222\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CSA13 Window Casement Stay Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nManufactured by <a href=\"/collections/deltana\">Deltana</a>, a architectural  hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CSA13 13\" Casement Stay:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Diameter: 3/8\" High x 5/8\" Wide</li>\r\n<li>Adjuster Holes: Spread 1-3/8\" Apart</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CSA13.pdf?v=1691095313\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  CSA13 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 13 Inch Colonial Casement Window Stay Adjuster, Deltana CSA13",
                "description": "Solid Brass Colonial Style 13 Inch Window Stay Adjuster Deltana CSA13 - Casement stays hold casement style windows (windows that swing open) in place at a set opening. This 13 Inch Window Casement Stay Adjuster is made of heavy duty solid brass construction for lasting quality. The colonial design makes it perfect for traditional style homes. It is slim enough that it will not steal the show from the view outside the window, but those who do notice it, will see the sleek style. It is available in 8 high quality finishes and packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n",
